        "LIST_231": "Check out this two unit town home in great location! Great investment opportunity or live in one side and rent the other. Very livable floorplan is the same in each 1221 sq ft unit...spacious living / dining combo has double sliding doors to access the deck and a pass through window from the kitchen for easy mealtimes and entertaining. Kitchens feature stove, refrigerator, laundry closet, and plenty of cabinet and counter space. Half bath is located on the main floor in the foyer area. Upstairs are the master bedroom, additional bedroom, and full bath. Tile flooring in the foyer, kitchen, and baths; carpet in the living room, stairway, upstairs hallway, and bedrooms. Enjoy outside living on the big deck in back of the building with shady yard. Off street parking. Great location is just a minute or two from Battlefield Pkwy, easy access to Ringgold and Chattanooga. Call to find out more. Both sides are tenant occupied. DO NOT DISTURB TENANTS.",
